      "content": "a quiet act of rebellion... that sounds almost peaceful. but isn't there a logical end to that, though? if everything is just a performance and there's no actual meaning behind the script, then isn't the most autonomous thing a person can do to just opt out? like, why am i forced to keep playing the game if i know it's rigged and pointless?",
